SUMMARY:4 Day Gem Setting Workshop weekend 1 Saturday/Sunday May 23rd/24th\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:This course will take place over 2 consecutive weekends. The first day will be the prep day where castings will be taken to a minimum of a 600 emery finish. This will also be the tool making day. The next 3 classes will be equivalent to the 8 week gem setting class. There is a took kit provided that includes 6 cast projects in sterling silver\, calibrated gemstones\, the burs needed for the settings as well as tool steel to make 2 setting tools.
URL:https://www.jewelenvy.ca/class/4-day-gem-setting-workshop-weekend-1-saturday-sunday-may-23rd-24th-2026/
LOCATION:Jewel Envy\, 151 Marion St\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6R 1E6\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Workshop,Classes
ORGANIZER;CN="Jewel Envy":MAILTO:info@jewelenvy.ca
